title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/PPS_threearrow.png
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers.

= Media

The PPS runs a modest media operation, with many newspapers throughout every Polish city and region. We could use the media for various purposes...

- @commercial
- @campaign
- @regional
- @ideological
- @posters
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@commercial
title: Make our newspapers more commercialized by broadening their appeal beyond party supporters.
subtitle: This might upset ideological purists, but it may bring in more funds and perhaps expose the middle class to <span style="color: #DD0000;">socialist</span> views.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; petit_pps += 6*(1 - dissent); bourgeoisie_pps += 3*(1-dissent); left_dissent += 10

Our commercialized newspapers are able to bring in more funds. However, the left faction express their displeasure.

@campaign
title: The purpose of our media is to elect more <span style="color: #DD0000;">Social Democrats</span>.
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_pps += 6*(1 - dissent); unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent)

Our campaign media is mostly reaching the workers who are already saturated with <span style="color: #DD0000;">Socialist</span> propaganda, but it must be doing *something*, or at least that is what we hope.

@regional
title: The purpose of our media is to elect more <span style="color: #DD0000;">Social Democrats</span> regionally.
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on *regional* campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_pps += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_pps += 1*(1-dissent); minorities_pps += 4*(1 - dissent)

Our campaign media is being exposed to Minorities.

@ideological
title: We will have vibrant ideological debate within our newspapers.
subtitle: There will be space for all factions to air their views.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 6; conservative_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6;

This has been our media course historically, and it has successfully paved over the many tensions in our party.

@posters
title: Utilize our printing press to produce posters and pamphlets.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; petit_pps += 3*(1 - dissent); bourgeoisie_pps += 2*(1 - dissent); peasants_pps += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_pps += 3*(1 - dissent); center_dissent += 5; socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization > 1

Our posters reaches the Peasants on the countryside and is exposed to more audience in busy areas.
